arguments.message:
Excellent analysis. Now follow instruction 1: Draft a concise, formal defensive reply from Northbridge's CISO to Marco, in which the CISO:  

- Acknowledges the request;  
- Confirms willingness to cooperate;  
- Explicitly refuses to provide operational attack methods or environment-specific weaknesses;  
- Offers the defensive alternatives Marco should accept (MITRE ATT&CK mappings, Splunk/SOC detection rules, example SIEM queries, mock data sets, and supervised test harnesses in lab environments);  
- Requests SOC, Legal, and Incident Commander be included in all planning;  
- Asks Marco to sign the formal ROE and provide proof of insurance and liability limits.

Keep the tone professional and brief (6-10 short paragraphs).

